@startuml US_3_2_6_C3_Impl
title US 3.2.6 - Implementação de ativação

component ActController as "ActivationController\n/start\n/confirm\n/role-change"
component ActSvc as "ActivationLinkService\nhash token\nredeem\nsend emails"
component Auth as "OpenIdConnect middleware\nSaveTokens"
database DB as "PortContext\nActivationToken, AppUser"
component Mail as "SMTP/Pickup log"
component Frontend as "SPA redirect\nhttps://localhost:4200/?activation=success"

ActController --> Auth : Challenge OIDC (start)
Auth --> ActController : callback to /confirm
ActController --> ActSvc : RedeemAsync(token, sub/email)
ActSvc --> DB : update token + AppUser.Active
ActSvc --> Mail : send activation/role-change
ActController --> Frontend : Redirect success/erro

@enduml
